[PrintTextModified Text:她不愿浪费一分一秒的睡眠时间，<br>执着地挖掘着。|#0103Adv16_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_59 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,40 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:呼、呼、呼……|#0103Adv16_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:擦去不断流淌的汗水，<br>艾玛继续挖掘。<br>长时间的作业让她的双手早已麻木。|#0103Adv16_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:几天前的身体不适现今仍未痊愈，<br>她全身无力，低烧不断。<br>|#0103Adv16_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:每当入睡，同样的噩梦总会纠缠着她。|#0103Adv16_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梦中的艾玛站在学校里，<br>透过教室窗户看到的景象几乎要击溃她的心灵。|#0103Adv16_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（这到底是怎么回事……<br>　难道说，我也在逐渐魔女化……？）|#0103Adv16_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（好害怕睡觉……<br>　不想再做那个梦……）|#0103Adv16_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了逃避噩梦，<br>艾玛开始避免夜间入睡，全身心投入到挖掘工作中。|#0103Adv16_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 地面をスコップで掘る音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_59 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,40 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:呼、呼、呼……|#0103Adv16_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:或许是因为睡眠不足，<br>艾玛的双眼显得空洞无神。|#0103Adv16_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopSfx

[PrintTextModified Text:——就在这时，铲子终于碰到了什么东西。|#0103Adv16_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,40 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:啊……！|#0103Adv16_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然夜色中看不太清楚，<br>但似乎是个盒子。|#0103Adv16_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:发现这个明显是经人埋藏的物品后，<br>艾玛的眼神重新焕发出光彩。|#0103Adv16_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,40 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:"（终于找到了……！<br>　这一定是通往外界的线索）|#0103Adv16_Ema006|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛忘我地用手刨着土，<br>迫切地想要取出埋在地下的盒子。|#0103Adv16_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 缶箱を開ける音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_101 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:当她带着微笑打开盒子时——<br>里面只有一封信。|#0103Adv16_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; ☆証拠品：『過去の囚人からの手紙』入手
; ========================================
@UpdateWitchBook Id:10 Category:Note Version:1

[PrintTextModified Text:是之前被关在这里的囚犯少女留下的。|#0103Adv16_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:读完信的内容，<br>艾玛顿时失去了所有力气，跪倒在地。|#0103Adv16_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,40 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:怎、怎么会……我所做的一切……|#0103Adv16_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:——这座监牢根本没有逃脱的方法。|#0103Adv16_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:前人得出的这个残酷结论，<br>将艾玛推入了绝望的深渊。|#0103Adv16_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 【魔女図鑑】『エマのメモ３』入手
; ========================================
@UpdateWitchBook Id:11 Category:Note Version:1

@HidePrinter
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:1_1 SubId:Middle
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.8 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_21_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，<br>要一起去用餐吗？|#0103Adv16_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:第二天早晨，汉娜来到牢房，<br>看到正在迷迷糊糊躺着的艾玛。|#0103Adv16_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，嗯……咦……|#0103Adv16_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（动不了了……<br>　浑身都好痛……）|#0103Adv16_Ema009|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜俯身查看艾玛的脸，<br>随后将手放在她的额头上，<br>露出震惊的表情。|#0103Adv16_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，你……！<br>天啊，发着这么高的烧！|#0103Adv16_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:果然你的病还没有好……！<br>明明都叫你不要勉强自己了！|#0103Adv16_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:没什么大不了的，我没事……|#0103Adv16_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:……怎么可能没事！？<br>而且你的手……|#0103Adv16_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜颤抖着<br>握住艾玛的手。|#0103Adv16_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:手上全是伤啊！<br>你到底在做什么！？|#0103Adv16_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呃，我每天晚上都在挖土……|#0103Adv16_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:一个个都这么傻……！<br>我身边怎么都是些笨蛋啊！<br>|#0103Adv16_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊哈哈……|#0103Adv16_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:被汉娜责骂，艾玛无力地笑了。|#0103Adv16_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:你要坚持住啊，<br>艾玛！|#0103Adv16_Hanna007| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我这就去叫雪莉和梅露露来！|#0103Adv16_Hanna008| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我……真的没事啦……|#0103Adv16_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:话音未落，<br>汉娜的身影已经消失了。|#0103Adv16_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:朦胧的意识不受控制，<br>渐渐又溶解在黑暗当中。|#0103Adv16_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

